@namespace Lumeo.Docs.Shared.Showcases

@* CTASection's own inner wrapper hardcodes py-16/py-20 + text-3xl/4xl — a full-size
   band doesn't fit a 236px preview box, so TitleSlot swaps in compact markup
   (bypassing the fixed-size h2) instead of Title, per the wave brief's "cropped,
   scaled-down slice" guidance. The section clips at the bottom if its padding
   still exceeds the box — accepted, same as any oversized showcase (see
   Showcases/README.md / CatalogCard's overflow-hidden note). *@
<div class="w-full max-w-[22rem] overflow-hidden">
    <CTASection Class="border-0">
        <TitleSlot>
            <Lumeo.Text Class="text-lg font-bold text-foreground">Ready to get started?</Lumeo.Text>
        </TitleSlot>
        <Actions>
            <Button Size="Button.ButtonSize.Sm">Get Started</Button>
        </Actions>
    </CTASection>
</div>
